\n## 2. Setting Up Your Workspace\n\n- **Equipment:** A monitor, keyboard, and mouse, ideally at eye level and a comfortable distance from your chair.\n- **Connectivity:** A wired connection is most reliable. If you use Wi-Fi, test your speed and keep the router within reach of your desk.\n- **Software:** Install the company VPN, messaging app, and video conferencing tool before your first day.\n- **Environment:** Choose a spot with minimal noise and distractions, and keep a consistent work area.\n\n## 3. Working Effectively\n\n- **Schedule:** Set consistent working hours and share them with your team.\n- **Communication:** Update your status when you step away, and respond to messages within a reasonable window.\n- **Breaks:** Step away from the screen at least once an hour to stretch and reset.\n- **Boundaries:** When the workday ends, close your work apps and log off to protect your time off.\n```\n\nTo generate the table of contents automatically, render the file with a tool that supports the `[TOC]` marker, such as Python-Markdown, Typora, or Obsidian. With Pandoc, use `pandoc --toc -s guide.md -o guide.html` instead and remove the `[TOC]` line."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":567,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":567},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"da4c910d-c579-41c0-9498-d779e7bc9f75","uuid":"fae85a94-5ae5-454f-b417-d69c5499cbf0","timestamp":"2026-10-15T15:05:30.116Z","request_id":"req_011Cg4EFVJMs5DU1vgyWMRWt"},{"type":"rate_limit_event","rate_limit_info":{"status":"allowed","resetsAt":1792093800,"rateLimitType":"five_hour","overageStatus":"rejected","overageDisabledReason":"out_of_credits","isUsingOverage":false,"unifiedWindows":{"five_h